  "name": "Macaroni Salad with Pickles",
  "subtitle": "A creamy, crisp salad with sweet pickle flavor",
  "description": "Tender macaroni, eggs, vegetables, olives, and pickles are folded into a seasoned creamy dressing and chilled before serving.",
